    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d62">

                <pb facs="0329" n="224" xml:id="pg224"/>

                <head>62. Note From Cutler to Goodpaster<anchor n="1" xml:id="d62-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1958-06-18">June 18, 1958</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d62-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d62-1"/>
                <p>For your information, I enclose a draft of some rough notes I made at the
                        Dulles/McElroy Conference Tuesday
                    afternoon.</p>
                <p>Obviously, these should be very closely held.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Robert
                            Cutler</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d62-a1.xml" xpointer="d62-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d62-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d62-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Strategic concept for the defense of Europe. Top Secret. 5 pp. Eisenhower
                    Library, White House Office Files, Records of the Office of the Staff Secretary,
                    Nuclear Exchange.</p>
            </note>
